    "note": "Three separately declared families of three tests each; raw and Holm-adjusted p reported. The multiplicity denominator is the DECLARED family size, so a missing or failed test blocks the comparison instead of shrinking the correction. Do NOT infer equivalence from a nonsignificant interaction."
  }
}